            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>At first glance, this figure appears to be a humanoid-shaped collection of thorny vines topped with a shock of red hair. Closer inspection reveals glowing red eyes hidden in the morass, full of cruelty and malice. Also known as roseblood sprites, veredrams embody the thorns of the rose—danger and pain hidden amongst beauty.</p><hr /><p>Elusive, flighty, and ebullient, sprites are what many villagers first imagine when they hear the terms \"fey\" or \"fairy.\"</p>",
